Package: SurplusProductionModel
Type: Package
Title: Pella-Tomlinson Surplus Production Model
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Alistair", "Dunn", 
           email = "alistair.dunn@oceanenvironmental.co.nz", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Author: Alistair Dunn [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Alistair Dunn <alistair.dunn@oceanenvironmental.co.nz>
Description: 
    A state-space spatial Pella-Tomlinson surplus production model. This 
    package provides the MSE foundation, implementing biomass-based 
    assessment with spatial structure and shape parameter flexibility. 
    Includes Schaefer (m=2) and Fox (m=1) as special cases.
